msgid "Import the necessary libraries."
msgstr "必要なライブラリをインポートします。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:50002
#: 34778c29c5494847b2067851bcdedbf9
msgid "1. ScalarField Initialization and Metadata"
msgstr "1\\. ScalarField の初期化とメタデータ"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:50004
#: a8bf88c437cc4a139bae613161ea2852
msgid "Create a `ScalarField` object and check its metadata."
msgstr "`ScalarField` オブジェクトを作成し、そのメタデータを確認します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:70002
#: 07b1043625994201b90461803ba315de
msgid "Checking Metadata"
msgstr "メタデータの確認"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:70004
#: bda0b0f01642496fa01a628d71ec6176
msgid "`axis0_domain`: Domain of axis 0 (\"time\" or \"frequency\")"
msgstr "`axis0_domain`: 軸0のドメイン（\"time\" または \"frequency\"）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:70005
#: 3adb320c18284539b6227ee41e370813
msgid "`space_domains`: Domain of each spatial axis (\"real\" or \"k\")"
msgstr "`space_domains`: 各空間軸のドメイン（\"real\" または \"k\"）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:70006
#: 85b0789270e94800bb63e841cd80e3f2
msgid "`axis_names`: Name of each axis"
msgstr "`axis_names`: 各軸の名前"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:70008
#: 5eecf6ee46ae4e528f81d6e6d972f88e
msgid "These metadata are automatically updated during FFT transformations."
msgstr "これらのメタデータは、FFT変換時に自動的に更新されます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:80002
#: 9b98b567db4e445d8fe617b5ebb0cf4d
msgid "2. Slicing with 4D Structure Preservation"
msgstr "2\\. 4D構造を保持するスライシング"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:80004
#: d18eb1f39b84479e859a9d97a3610590
msgid ""
"An important feature of `ScalarField` is that it **always maintains 4 "
"dimensions even when sliced**. Even when using integer indices, they are "
"automatically converted to length-1 slices."
msgstr ""
"`ScalarField` の重要な特徴は、**スライシングしても常に4次元を維持する**ことです。 "
"整数インデックスを使っても、自動的に長さ1のスライスに変換されます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:80007
#: c352cdd6d23f4be697b7ad1eeaac3b4e
msgid ""
"**Caution:** avoid calling `np.squeeze()` (or any equivalent shape-dropping "
"step) unless you explicitly want to leave the Field API. Keeping singleton "
"axes preserves axis metadata and makes later FFT or plotting steps less "
"error-prone."
msgstr ""
"**注意:** `np.squeeze()` のような軸を落とす処理は、Field API "
"の外に出たい場合に限って使ってください。長さ1の軸を保つことで、軸メタデータが維持され、その後の FFT や可視化でも扱いを誤りにくくなります。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:110002
#: 2620f66e67c144be940cbd0e0a876652
msgid ""
"This behavior maintains the consistency of ScalarField objects, and metadata"
" (axis names and domain information) are never lost."
msgstr "この挙動により、ScalarFieldオブジェクトの一貫性が保たれ、メタデータ（軸名やドメイン情報）が失われることがありません。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:120002
#: 18b5657b7a694d639acd081a686181c9
msgid "3. Time-Frequency Transformation (FFT on Axis 0)"
msgstr "3\\. 時間-周波数変換（軸0のFFT）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:120004
#: a4637e0b7a6b474494b28a6726070ef8
msgid ""
"You can transform the time axis to the frequency axis using the `fft_time()`"
" and `ifft_time()` methods. The same normalization as GWpy's "
"`TimeSeries.fft()` is adopted."
msgstr ""
"`fft_time()` と `ifft_time()` メソッドを使って、時間軸を周波数軸に変換できます。 GWpy の "
"`TimeSeries.fft()` と同じ正規化を採用しています。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:150002
#: f4e07b9b511549a1b8507930f168d5cd
msgid "Inverse FFT (Frequency → Time)"
msgstr "逆FFT（周波数 → 時間）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:150004
#: 661baee312cd4ec0ba7113bf4a0fa04c
msgid "You can return to the original time domain with `ifft_time()`."
msgstr "`ifft_time()` で元の時間ドメインに戻すことができます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:170002
#: b5712c4d314a4265b60f36d51e279381
msgid "4. Real Space-K Space Transformation (FFT on Spatial Axes)"
msgstr "4\\. 実空間-K空間変換（空間軸のFFT）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:170004
#: d09124736a80453d845a64add27ceb3c
msgid ""
"You can transform spatial axes to wavenumber space (K-space) using "
"`fft_space()` and `ifft_space()`. Signed FFT with angular wavenumber k = 2π "
"/ λ is used."
msgstr ""
"`fft_space()` と `ifft_space()` を使って、空間軸を波数空間（K空間）に変換できます。 角波数 k = 2π / λ "
"の符号付きFFTを使用します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:200002
#: d52427eec0e34792aefb9c50d30bab01
msgid "Wavelength Calculation"
msgstr "波長の計算"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:200004
#: 7bd84652f24042e393068878617ce885
msgid ""
"In K-space, you can calculate the wavelength using the `wavelength()` "
"method."
msgstr "K空間では、`wavelength()` メソッドで波長を計算できます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:220002
#: b092eeaa37be47a9af413f25b84911fe
msgid "FFT on All Spatial Axes"
msgstr "全空間軸のFFT"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:220004
#: d79c263db4ab47aeabea8798957450a9
msgid ""
"If you omit the `axes` parameter, you can FFT all spatial axes together."
msgstr "`axes` パラメータを省略すると、全空間軸をまとめてFFTできます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:240002
#: 0f7c18c979c64d269173e0ef0de9f9aa
msgid "5. Batch Operations with FieldList and FieldDict"
msgstr "5\\. FieldList と FieldDict によるバッチ操作"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:240004
#: 7b385e5b641f4b268a8f31ec87683d26
msgid ""
"To process multiple `ScalarField` objects together, use `FieldList` or "
"`FieldDict`."
msgstr ""
"複数の `ScalarField` オブジェクトをまとめて処理するには、`FieldList` または `FieldDict` を使用します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:250002
#: 9249bad6b25f447184f3775ea01c36e2
msgid "FieldList"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:250004
#: e630fb4be991415c9dfdd3fd6f38f6d2
msgid ""
"Manage multiple fields in list format and apply FFT operations in bulk."
msgstr "リスト形式で複数のフィールドを管理し、一括でFFT操作を適用できます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:280002
#: 6a06d33427ca4e9a86170e5cd4a36a23
msgid "FieldDict"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:280004
#: 2e60f75c079f49079a0223cbf3f339ef
msgid "Manage named fields in dictionary format."
msgstr "辞書形式で名前付きフィールドを管理します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:310002
#: 0a86c8f97a374f83807360b2572ebeb3
msgid "6. Signal Processing and Analysis"
msgstr "6\\. 信号処理と解析"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:310004
